{"title":"MCP server","description":"Let Claude, Codex, VS Code or any MCP client run Stirling PDF tools for you over the Model Context Protocol.","unlisted":false,"space":"mcp","layout":"","article":"\n    <h1>MCP server</h1>\n<p>Stirling PDF has a built-in <a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Model Context Protocol</a> (MCP) server. Connect an AI assistant such as Claude, Codex or VS Code, and it can convert, edit, secure and process documents with your Stirling PDF tools. Every action runs as your account.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Where Stirling PDF runs</th>\n<th>MCP endpoint</th>\n<th>Sign-in</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Stirling Cloud</td>\n<td><code>https://api.stirling.com/mcp</code></td>\n<td>Your Stirling account. No key to copy.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Self-hosted server</td>\n<td><code>https://your-server/mcp</code></td>\n<td>OAuth or API key, set by your admin. Off by default.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"cards cards-3\"><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"mcp\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22v-5M9 8V2M15 8V2M18 8v5a6 6 0 0 1-12 0V8z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/MCP/Connect/\">Connect a client</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Snippets for Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Codex and VS Code.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"mcp\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"/><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/MCP/Tools/\">Tools reference</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>The tools the server exposes, their arguments and results.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"server\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 21v-7M4 10V3M12 21v-9M12 8V3M20 21v-5M20 12V3M1 14h6M9 8h6M17 16h6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Automation/MCP-Server/\">Server settings</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>For admins: turn MCP on and choose how clients sign in.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p>To call Stirling PDF from your own code instead, see the <a href=\"/Developers/API/\">REST API</a>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/MCP/MCP.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"","pager":"<span></span><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/MCP/Connect/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Connect a client</span>\n      </a>"}